<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Radisys downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Radisys downgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Jensen Securities said it downgraded RadiSys Corp to neutral from outperform.</p>
<p>-- cited stock price appreciation. Shares closed Monday up one to 44-1/2.</p>
</text>
